{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Looking for a Job", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Just Waiting", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 10, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 3, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Discuss factual and abstract information about common everyday or job related topics in both work and social contexts appropriate for the interlocutor.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn10le03ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "push factors", "type": "name"}, {"content": " reasons that force an individual or an organization to make changes", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Due to push factors such as the rise of the Internet, globalization and outsourcing, there is an increased push for efficiency.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le03ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about how work is changing.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "globalization", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the movement towards increased trade and communications between people in different countries", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The Internet, globalization and outsourcing, helped with the increased push for efficiency.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le03ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "outsourcing", "type": "name"}, {"content": " the business strategy of having work completed in other parts of the world in order to lower costs", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Outsourcing contributed to the push for efficiency and effectiveness, while maintaining quality in the newspaper business.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le03ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "news outlet", "type": "name"}, {"content": " an organization that provides information about what is going on, like a newspaper", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: News outlets were no exception.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le03ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "innovation", "type": "name"}, {"content": "change leading to an improved way of doing things", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They say that innovation is the key to success today.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le03ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "efficiency", "type": "name"}, {"content": "doing something in an easier, faster or cheaper way", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Now, with newspapers, there is an increased push for efficiency.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le03ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "effectiveness", "type": "name"}, {"content": "doing something in a better way", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Today the newspaper industry calls for an increased push for efficiency and effectiveness, while maintaining quality. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le03ob10aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Simple Present, Present Continuous, Simple Past and Present Perfect Tenses", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "These four tenses all have very different uses. It is important that you understand the differences so that you can communicate your ideas in an efficient and comprehensive way. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Look at the chart as reference:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning/Use\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Structure\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Simple Present</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"express habits/truths</br></br>scheduled event/plan\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"subject + verb + object\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">They say that innovation is the key to success today.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Continuous</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"action in progress at the time of speaking</br><br/>planned action in the future</br>habitual action\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"subject + <span class=\\\"italic\\\">am</span>/<span class=\\\"italic\\\">is</span>/<span class=\\\"italic\\\">are</span> + verb <span class=\\\"italic\\\">-ing</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm starting the job next week.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Simple Past</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"completed past action\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"subject + verb + object\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I was tired of just waiting. It took a lot of courage, but I finally met him.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Perfect</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"past action at an unspecified  time </br></br>action that started in the past and is continuing now\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"subject + <span class=\\\"italic\\\">has</span>/<span class=\\\"italic\\\">have</span> + past participle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">He has asked for two letters of reference.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "In the past, organizations <span class=\"strong\">survived</span> by focusing on providing quality products.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Modern internet users <span class=\"strong\">have</span> so many choices about where to get their news. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Expressing Necessity at Work: <span class=\"italic\">Need</span> + Passive Infinitive and <span class=\"italic\">Need</span> + Gerund", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use <span class=\"italic\">need</span> + <span class=\"strong\">passive infinitive</span> and <span class=\"italic\">need</span> + verb <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span> to talk about necessity. </br> You use these structures to focus on the <span class=\"strong\">thing </span>that needs doing, not the person who is doing it.</br> In workplace scenarios, it is common for people to talk in more indirect ways. This kind of communication is more polite. Passive structures are part of this indirect method of communication.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "In this structure, the subject of the sentence is the thing that needs doing.  </br></br> Subject + <span class=\"italic\">Need</span> + <span class=\"strong\">Passive Infinitive</span></br></br><span class=\"italic\">I decided I needed to be noticed, not just be a r\u00e9sum\u00e9 on a pile.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you use <span class=\"italic\">need</span> with a <span class=\"strong\">gerund </span>(verb <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span>), it takes on a passive meaning. </br></br>  Subject + <span class=\"italic\">Need</span> + Verb <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span> </br></br><span class=\"italic\"> From what I can tell, BFP needs adapting.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "News organizations <span class=\"strong\">need to be changed</span>.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The realities of our readership <span class=\"strong\">need to be understood</span>. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I read about globalization and outsourcing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I discuss the impact of globalization and outsourcing on my area of work or study.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write sentences explaining my opinion.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "With a partner, review what is meant by \"globalization\" and \"outsourcing\". Go online to find more information on these topics.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Discuss how you feel about these topics. What may be good about them? What is bad? In general, do you think they are positive or negative trends? ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Discuss how these trends are affecting the area in which you work or study. Try to find 5 things that are changing because of globalization and outsourcing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a short paragraph summarizing your conversation.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to be a r\u00e9sum\u00e9 on a pile", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be one of many applicants", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " I decided I needed to be noticed, not just be a r\u00e9sum\u00e9 on a pile.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le03ob10aud08", "type": "audio"}]}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "img_path": "", "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can request or report facts about events or actions related to work and