zation and outsourcing on your area of work or study.\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn10le03ob10re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 1, "id": 0, "selected": 0}], "id": 0}]}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "template_override": 1, "contents": [{}]}, {"_data": [], "id": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn10le03ob10re2img07.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn10le03ob10re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn10le03ob10re2img07.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn10le03ob10re2img07.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>:  Nice to see you, Adam. How's the job search going?\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I'm doing my best, but it's not easy.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I know.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Did you accept the job at BFP?\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Yes, I accepted the job as soon as they offered it to me. I'm starting next week.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: That's great!\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Did you ever find out why they removed the job posting from the website?\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I'm not sure why, but I was able to meet with Mr. Brody.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: That's amazing!"}, {"time": "22500", "image": "engenn10le03ob10re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I was tired of just waiting. It took a lot of courage, but I finally met him. I decided I needed to be noticed, not just be a r\u00e9sum\u00e9 on a pile. He was impressed by my elevator speech.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: As he should be! We worked on it so much.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: After the pitch, we talked about different things while we were in his office, like the future of journalism.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>:  He's a kind man.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: He has asked for two letters of reference.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: That sounds very promising!\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Ever since I met him, I've had the sense he is looking for people with bold ideas who aren't afraid to propose changes. They say that innovation is the key to success today. From what I can tell, BFP needs adapting.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: That's true."}, {"time": "63000", "image": "engenn10le03ob10re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: We talked a lot about that in some of my communications courses. In the past, organizations survived by focusing on providing quality products.  News outlets were no exception. If they kept delivering the newspaper, they were fine.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: But things have changed.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Yes. News organizations need to be changed. Due to push factors such as the rise of the internet, globalization and outsourcing, there is an increased push for efficiency and effectiveness, while maintaining quality.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Yes, but the realities of our readership need to be understood.  Modern internet users have so many choices about where to get their news. They won't accept mediocrity because they know they can easily go somewhere else."}]}}], "title": "", "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}